---
const {
  title = "Home",
  subtitle = "Subtítulo",
  description = "Descripción",
  image = "/images/unsplash_1.jpg",
} = Astro.props;
---

<section id="home" class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center px-6 pt-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">{title}</h1>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-300">{subtitle}</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-400">{description}</p>
      <p> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Odit eveniet nam voluptatibus tenetur amet recusandae delectus culpa non. Tempora, porro alias modi maxime beatae a suscipit, quia ratione soluta nemo animi obcaecati sed debitis temporibus iure ipsa? Eligendi iusto officia incidunt dolorum tempora porro maiores, quidem doloribus corrupti aspernatur esse dolor modi impedit fugit atque distinctio beatae ut veritatis! Autem?</p>
    </div>

   <img
  src={image}
  alt="Imagen principal"
  class="w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl shadow-xl"
/>
  </div>
</section>

